sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as React Client
  participant P as Audio Player
  participant A as Express API
  participant DB as MongoDB
  U->>C: Click a song
  C->>P: playTrack(song)
  P->>P: load audio_url, start playback
  P-->>U: Audio plays, play bar updates
  C->>A: POST /api/songs/:id/play (optionalAuth)
  A->>DB: increment play_count, set last_played_at
  alt User authenticated
    A->>DB: create ListeningHistory record
    DB-->>A: saved
  end
  A-->>C: 200 playback info
  Note over A,DB: History feeds the Analytics dashboard
